        <mxCell id="t4" value="Generic CLD derived from the COMPLETE FBMC — one variable per canvas block, no use case. Colours = source FBMC block group (legend below). Instantiation = renaming these variables for a concrete business (e.g. PV), never inventing unanchored ones." style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
