        <mxCell id="sd-e9" edge="1" parent="1" source="sd-sde" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=0;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;dashed=1" target="sd-sv" value="same registry ID,&#xa;same name">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sd-n1" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=#d6b656;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11" value="FBMC → SD TYPE-LEVEL DERIVATION RULES (via sdTypeHint)&#xa;• Resource / BiophysicalStock / accumulating relationship → Level (Stock)&#xa;• Activity / Channel engagement / co-creation, co-destruction → Rate (Flow)&#xa;• Perception / quality / service / capacity → Auxiliary&#xa;• Governance choice / policy lever → Constant (Parameter)&#xa;• Goal + Indicator → Output Auxiliary (MUST appear in the model, I6)&#xa;SDType in the registry IS the sdTypeHint; Vensim kind mapping in Lists!H:I" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="430" x="1150" y="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sd-n2" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=#d6b656;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11" value="SD WELL-FORMEDNESS INVARIANT (I8, machine-checked)&#xa;• Unit consistency: for every Flow→Stock causal link,&#xa;  unit(flow) = unit(stock)/time   (e.g. actors/year → actors)&#xa;• Only Rates change Levels: a Stock fed directly by a&#xa;  non-Flow variable needs an intermediating Rate in SD (WARN)&#xa;• Every SDVariable keeps its registry ID and unit — no drift" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="430" x="1150" y="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sd-n3" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=#d6b656;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11" value="PROJECTION (deliberately OUT OF SCOPE for now — conceptual + registry level only)&#xa;When needed (backlog P4): a generator projects Concepts+CausalLinks to a Vensim&#xa;.mdl skeleton — Levels as INTEG(Σinflows − Σoutflows, init), units from the Unit&#xa;column. Until then the registry itself is the single SD-ready source of truth." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="430" x="1150" y="450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sd-n4" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=#d6b656;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11" value="MATURITY: CLD (page 2) captures causal structure; SD adds computability&#xa;(equations, units, time). Nothing conceptual changes — the same&#xa;MeasurableAttributes project to CLD variables AND SD variables (page 3 bridge)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="280" x="850" y="450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
